    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Philip Wood, an associate professor at the Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations, has been awarded a British Academy Mid-Career Fellowship for his project  The Islamicate Church and the World of Dionysius of Tel-Mahre, 750-850 .",
